de with this code.\n```GDScript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tget_tree().get_root().gui_embed_subwindows = false\n\tvar win = Window.new()\n\twin.mode = Window.MODE_MINIMIZED\n\tadd_child(win)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n[bugmini-4.4b4.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18890013/bugmini-4.4b4.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Thorgrimar","id":20028170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDI4MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20028170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar","html_url":"https://github.com/Thorgrimar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thorgrimar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103081/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}